or_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Regression - this was introduced by PR #120354, merged yesterday.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (57277407e) - macOS Sequoia (15.7.4) - Multi-window, 2 monitors (1920x1080 @ 60.00 Hz, 1920x1080 @ 60.00 Hz) - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M4 (Apple9) - Apple M4 (10 threads) - 16.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis PR #120354 accidentally introduced a bug where the editor will throw errors when duplicating nested instantiated scenes. The errors derive from `Node::_duplicate_script()` and `Node::_duplicate_properties`.\n\nThis means that properties and scripts will not be recursively duplicated for nested instances, though they should be.\n\nThis is easily fixable and I'm opening a PR shortly to fix this!\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1) In a brand new project, create two scenes (main.tscn and subscene.tscn).\n2) Add a root node to main.tscn and save it.\n2) Add a root node AND a single child node subscene.tscn and save subscene.tscn.\n3) Add an instance of subscene.tscn in the main scene, and save main.tscn.\n4) Right click on the root node of main.tscn, click Copy, and observe the errors:\n```\n- ERROR: Node not found: \"Subscene/SubsceneChild\" (relative to \"Subscene\").\n- ERROR: Child node disappeared while duplicating.\n- ERROR: Node not found: \"Subscene/SubsceneChild\" (relative to \"Subscene\").\n- ERROR: Child node disappeared while duplicating.\n```\n\nDiagram of tree:\n(subscene.tscn)\n```\nSubscene\n> SubsceneChild\n```\n\n(main.tscn)\n```\nMain\n> Subscene (instance of subscene.tscn)\n>> SubsceneChild\n```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A, can be quickly reproduced in a brand new project","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123616/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123616/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}